## Conclusion

Cyber Threat Landscape Brief and Website Security Analyzer is a comprehensive cybersecurity project designed to monitor cyber threats, visualize security metrics, and evaluate website security. The platform combines threat intelligence, security analytics, and website assessment capabilities into a single dashboard. The project demonstrates the practical application of Python, Flask, HTML, CSS, JavaScript, SQLite, and cybersecurity concepts while providing a useful learning and monitoring tool for security enthusiasts and students.